<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Heng Fung shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Heng Fung shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of property concern Heng Fung Holdings Co Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Heng Fung shares ended HK$0.01 up at HK$0.55 on Wednesday on volume of 2.08 million shares.</p>
<p>Earlier this month, Heng Fung agreed to place 77.6 million new shares, or 19.8 percent of its existing share capital, to 10 private and individual investors at HK$0.42 per share, raising net proceeds of HK$31.9 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
